                       CONTINUE
               END-SEARCH.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-TAX-BAND-0052.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
